  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsProposalTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row1Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-44.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10.5pt;"&gt;(注) １  取締役中山正子氏、吉田至夫氏、阿部和人氏、三部正歳氏は、社外取締役です。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsProposalTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsProposalTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row2Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:40.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-14pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10.5pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;２  監査等委員以外の取締役の任期は、2024年６月期に係る定時株主総会終結の時までです。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsProposalTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsProposalTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row3Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:40.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-14pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10.5pt;"&gt;３  監査等委員である取締役の任期は、2025年６月期に係る定時株主総会終結の時までです。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsProposalTextBlock>
